lowed\" but I don't see it stating allowed on the issue here: https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/29 - can you confirm?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1315906719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1315918765","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613#issuecomment-1315918765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613","id":1315918765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Ob1Ot","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T22:04:03Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T22:08:17Z","body":"@jlovejoy, yes - this is one of the \"good\" licenses from the Callaway™ era that doesn't have an SPDX identifier (see: https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing/UCAR). I've been using the \"license::callaway\" label for these rather than the \"license::allowed\" label.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1315918765/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336286703","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613#issuecomment-1336286703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613","id":1336286703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Pph3v","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-04T00:28:00Z","updated_at":"2022-12-04T00:28:00Z","body":"+1 to add.\r\n\r\nThis one is a mish-mash of a few existing licenses. The preamble and clauses 1-3 are a near match for BSD-3-Clause, and the disclaimer is a near match for MIT. Clause 4 is a near match of the patent termination language from the Open Software License / Academic Free License family of licenses (e.g. [OSL-3.0 section 10](https://spdx.org/licenses/OSL-3.0.html)).\r\n\r\nGiven that, I think this mix of terms / conditions itself meets the \"is open source-ish\" part of the license inclusion principles. And I'd view its inclusion in a Fedora project as being sufficient for broad use.\r\n\r\nI'm fine with UCAR as the name / identifier, I don't have anything better to propose.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1336286703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1338751938","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613#issuecomment-1338751938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1613","id":1338751938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Py7vC","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-12-06T04:52:11Z","up